description: Next.js app shell, routing, static export
globs: src/app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

## Scope

`src/app/**` — layouts, pages, static export constraints.

## Constraints

- Static export only: no API routes, server actions, or SSR-only APIs.
- SPA on S3/CloudFront; locale via explicit `[locale]` segments + `generateStaticParams`.
- Lean route bundles; no heavy imports in root layout.

## Gotchas

- No `headers()`, `cookies()`, or server-only APIs in export paths.
- Do not detect locale at runtime; pre-render all locales.

## Example

```ts
// OK: locale from segment
const messages = (await import(`@/messages/${locale}.json`)).default;

// BAD: breaks static export
const locale = headers().get("x-next-intl-locale") ?? "en";
```
